              <XAxis dataKey="soc" label "SOC (%)">, <YAxis label "Power (kW)">, <Tooltip ChartTooltip>,
              <Area dataKey="power" name "Power" stroke CHART_COLORS[0] fill url(#curvePowerGrad) unit " kW">.
              No legend (single series). Empty handled by ChartContainer overlay when curveData has no rows.
